he page (~80 hours).\n\n## Conclusion\nAll three task requirements are fulfilled: a beginner-level relativity course was located (confirmed by screenshots), the main topics (8 modules) were listed, and the estimated completion time in hours (81 hours) was provided, consistent with the schedule shown on the course page.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
